{"3147730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Seed of God", "steam_appid": 3147730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CHALLENGE - Be the first one who beats the hardest boss to recieve a reward (Head to Forums and direct to my discord DM´s for more info.  Previous challenge winners are excluded from entering) (As long as this text is here noone has done it)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Stutter issues ? Leave fullscreen mode by pressing Alt+Enter. Access settings tab and change shadow quality back and forth one time) </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linux and Steamdeck not supported at the moment</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obs ! Amature Solo developed game ! </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Is It ?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jrpg with turnbased combat using a mix of 2D Pixel and 3D.  A story arc that stretch beyond what you may expect from a solodeveloped Jrpg project. My first, only and last game I will ever create and poured my heart and soul in this one for the brave few looking for a old school JRPG telling a unique story that will be something to remember. Being a Solo developed first game it will progressively play and look better as the game progress but will never completely go away from unpolish and surely a few bugs here and there and spelling errors so please set your expectations accordingly and think of it as FinalFantasy 7 but from Temu.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Plot twists , curve balls, politics, religion, love , hate , sorrow,  a mature adventure that sometimes is unfair and </i>you will either love or hate the characters in Seed of God but always have a desire to push on and explore  and experience  the journey together with the main cast in the kingdom of Riebenhelm in a  tragic but hopeful adventure.              Humor is blunt and direct, maybe even will shock you or make you burst in laughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put yourself into detective mode for this game will not hold your hand , if you solve a secret or mystery you will be rewarded with a feel that you accomplished using your own reasoning skills for game will not tell you with flashing map arrows where to go so pay attention to dialog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras/accabdc44cc8707d33f099835f67fdd2.avif?t=1785486442\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras_big/accabdc44cc8707d33f099835f67fdd2.avif?t=1785486442 width=800 height=186 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Avelon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A distant world surrounded by a endless Sea and shrouded in mist, protected by God, the Pillar of light.                Avelons inhabitants pray everyday to keep them safe.  <br>With fear everyone still remember what happend a millennia ago when God failed to protect. There is also whispers of a crazy king in the east and that he may once again put Avelon in danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras/6522ffe17713e39a72a11e93d2225fd5.avif?t=1785486442\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras_big/6522ffe17713e39a72a11e93d2225fd5.avif?t=1785486442 width=800 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras/3986253d7ab84dff580fb974b030bc06.avif?t=1785486442\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras_big/3986253d7ab84dff580fb974b030bc06.avif?t=1785486442 width=1560 height=602 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several towns with completely different mood and architecture with its own stores, libraries, taverns and more plus a few secrets awaits to be discovered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to people to uncover their personality and stories or initiate quests that will or will not reward you. Dive into the books at the library to understand more about the world or find solutions to mysteries , make decisions that will affect the game now or later or not at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the worldmap and explore the mainstory at your own pace. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras/dcc19b7ac3bfb20b6e5b409f096cc114.avif?t=1785486442\" width=800 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras/c24a78778c1ea17391308977142a7f1e.avif?t=1785486442\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras_big/c24a78778c1ea17391308977142a7f1e.avif?t=1785486442 width=800 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Good or Bad and even Romance ?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will constantly be faced with morale dilemmas or choices that define who you are or how events unfold now or later and can even affect relationship with characters in Kingdom of Riebenhelm. <br>But caution ! once a choice is made  there is no easy way of knowing what was affected  so you can not micromanage your Good/Bad/Romance points. Be prepared to live with the consequence of your choice.      </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras/f707652860a31c818276e7a56ac8f75f.avif?t=1785486442\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras_big/f707652860a31c818276e7a56ac8f75f.avif?t=1785486442 width=800 height=208 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earn Chards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use tokens earned through quests or combat to unlock new skills and magic. Earn money to shop for items and weapons in the many store areas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras/eb2c5d006354441397045375d022a292.avif?t=1785486442\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras_big/eb2c5d006354441397045375d022a292.avif?t=1785486442 width=800 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turnbased Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With several partymembers you combat both random encounters and visible threats using weapons , skills , items and magic and your partymembers brings their own unique weapons and skills to aid you in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience points to level up your stats and beat even greaters foes all who are unique to this world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras/e306b8cbf1d1f98b0c2497ece5220bb2.avif?t=1785486442\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras_big/e306b8cbf1d1f98b0c2497ece5220bb2.avif?t=1785486442 width=800 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras/e25cb280f383654d077c47c3f4323816.avif?t=1785486442\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras_big/e25cb280f383654d077c47c3f4323816.avif?t=1785486442 width=1560 height=598 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Influences</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The  era of SNES/PS1 JRPG and Finalfantasy 7 influenced greatly how character arcs and a story should be told. Game is best described as a darker and more mature version of Finalfantasy but retain the same storybeats and type of gameplay with larger than life story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New feature ! 28 outfits for cast members can be found</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras/14e8f4a6a5bfca9267e0c555f35416c2.avif?t=1785486442\" width=666 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story is unpredictable and aimed at a mature audience. Have little to none creative restrictions so expect unfiltered dialog and events at any given time as you travel the Kingdom of Riebenhelm. If you want a synopsis all i can say it is a tale of a Fathers bond to his daughter. A heroic adventure full of blood,misery,love,hate and shocking direct humor. It will take you through several towns and uniqe locations throughout the adventure and  characters  you meet on the way will be given  space to tell their story. Be sure to stop by one of the many taverns , they are the  real gems of Riebenhelm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game description and trailers are kept spoiler free to not give away casts , character and events. Expect a journey of EPIC proportions that will clock in at around 25 hours </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras/2990caf9fef2431c3af727fbc811ef26.avif?t=1785486442\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras/a4312936e20710951bb432366dc48a69.avif?t=1785486442\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to support / info or have any questions please visit the games discord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is the first step in larger project so if you find the world and characters intriguing and want more you are lucky because there are alot more going on behind the scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CHALLENGE - Be the first one who beats the hardest boss to recieve a reward (Head to Forums and direct to my discord DM´s for more info.  Previous challenge winners are excluded from entering) (As long as this text is here noone has done it)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Stutter issues ? Leave fullscreen mode by pressing Alt+Enter. Access settings tab and change shadow quality back and forth one time) </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linux and Steamdeck not supported at the moment</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obs ! Amature Solo developed game ! </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Is It ?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jrpg with turnbased combat using a mix of 2D Pixel and 3D.  A story arc that stretch beyond what you may expect from a solodeveloped Jrpg project. My first, only and last game I will ever create and poured my heart and soul in this one for the brave few looking for a old school JRPG telling a unique story that will be something to remember. Being a Solo developed first game it will progressively play and look better as the game progress but will never completely go away from unpolish and surely a few bugs here and there and spelling errors so please set your expectations accordingly and think of it as FinalFantasy 7 but from Temu.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Plot twists , curve balls, politics, religion, love , hate , sorrow,  a mature adventure that sometimes is unfair and </i>you will either love or hate the characters in Seed of God but always have a desire to push on and explore  and experience  the journey together with the main cast in the kingdom of Riebenhelm in a  tragic but hopeful adventure.              Humor is blunt and direct, maybe even will shock you or make you burst in laughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put yourself into detective mode for this game will not hold your hand , if you solve a secret or mystery you will be rewarded with a feel that you accomplished using your own reasoning skills for game will not tell you with flashing map arrows where to go so pay attention to dialog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras/accabdc44cc8707d33f099835f67fdd2.avif?t=1785486442\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras_big/accabdc44cc8707d33f099835f67fdd2.avif?t=1785486442 width=800 height=186 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Avelon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A distant world surrounded by a endless Sea and shrouded in mist, protected by God, the Pillar of light.                Avelons inhabitants pray everyday to keep them safe.  <br>With fear everyone still remember what happend a millennia ago when God failed to protect. There is also whispers of a crazy king in the east and that he may once again put Avelon in danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class