ll who are unique to this world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras/e306b8cbf1d1f98b0c2497ece5220bb2.avif?t=1785486442\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras_big/e306b8cbf1d1f98b0c2497ece5220bb2.avif?t=1785486442 width=800 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras/e25cb280f383654d077c47c3f4323816.avif?t=1785486442\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras_big/e25cb280f383654d077c47c3f4323816.avif?t=1785486442 width=1560 height=598 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Influences</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The  era of SNES/PS1 JRPG and Finalfantasy 7 influenced greatly how character arcs and a story should be told. Game is best described as a darker and more mature version of Finalfantasy but retain the same storybeats and type of gameplay with larger than life story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New feature ! 28 outfits for cast members can be found</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras/14e8f4a6a5bfca9267e0c555f35416c2.avif?t=1785486442\" width=666 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story is unpredictable and aimed at a mature audience. Have little to none creative restrictions so expect unfiltered dialog and events at any given time as you travel the Kingdom of Riebenhelm. If you want a synopsis all i can say it is a tale of a Fathers bond to his daughter. A heroic adventure full of blood,misery,love,hate and shocking direct humor. It will take you through several towns and uniqe locations throughout the adventure and  characters  you meet on the way will be given  space to tell their story. Be sure to stop by one of the many taverns , they are the  real gems of Riebenhelm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game description and trailers are kept spoiler free to not give away casts , character and events. Expect a journey of EPIC proportions that will clock in at around 25 hours </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras/2990caf9fef2431c3af727fbc811ef26.avif?t=1785486442\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras/a4312936e20710951bb432366dc48a69.avif?t=1785486442\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to support / info or have any questions please visit the games discord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is the first step in larger project so if you find the world and characters intriguing and want more you are lucky because there are alot more going on behind the scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Epic scale JRPG with turnbased combat.Make choices that define your morale (Good/Bad) or try score a romance. characterdriven story that will take you on a unforgettable journey in style of FinalFantasy. Explore the Worldmap, Towns, Dungeons and locations or try a minigame. Est playtime : 25hours", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/705c1492d2a2d1148d5355761d2f8f8b2b1611c4/header.jpg?t=1785486442", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/31477